{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a159c8-9e43-7f53-81d9-0ff77ddf20d6", "item_id": "call_ee0a0353a00f49acbd74baa67a4b0b08", "rollout_ordinal": 4568, "created_at_ms": 1792507693369, "item_type": "webSearch", "updated_at_ordinal": 4568, "started_at_ms": 1792507693369, "completed_at_ms": 1792507695226}, "item": {"type": "webSearch", "id": "call_ee0a0353a00f49acbd74baa67a4b0b08", "query": "https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp", "action": {"type": "openPage", "url": "https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp"}, "results": [{"type": "text_result", "domain": "github.com", "ref_id": "turn24view0", "snippet": "Total lines: 420", "thumbnail_url": "https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/q5MwmHDSZia0ymTXJthSXXAGUOX-bp2iXH-oPMAqhHcW4smETEiCCplXWnuHsiwO4_Q18EARPorcrIu-Zue1C6-3eByLo2-VZG6VB7nc0C2Imz3we85zFrj6dB-UZUdvQpsEyUtBnxC96TzgP98tkQ", "title": "GitHub - ggml-org/llama.cpp: LLM inference in C/C++ · GitHub", "url": "https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp"}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a159c8-9e43-7f53-81d9-0ff77ddf20d6", "item_id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016ad77f32976c87d2aecf3d1d21301972", "rollout_ordinal": 4571, "created_at_ms": 1792507697847, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4571, "started_at_ms": 1792507697847, "completed_at_ms": 1792507709582}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016ad77f32976c87d2aecf3d1d21301972", "text": "Sí. Para **Qwen3-0.6B en una versión comprimida de 4 bits**, podemos tomar esta referencia:\n\n| Recurso | Orientación para nuestra aplicación |\n|---|---|\n| **Procesador** | CPU moderna de 4 núcleos sería un punto de partida razonable. No es un mínimo oficial. |\n| **RAM del equipo** | **8 GB para probar; 16 GB para tener más margen** con la app abierta. |\n| **Memoria adicional del modelo** | Presupuestaría **1–2 GB libres**, con instrucciones cortas y una explicación a la vez. Es una estimación pendiente de medir. |\n| **Tarjeta gráfica** | **No es obligatoria**: puede ejecutarse en CPU mediante llama.cpp. |\n| **Disco** | El archivo Q4_0 ocupa **429 MB**; habría que sumar el motor de ejecución. |\n| **Internet** | Para descargarlo inicialmente; después puede funcionar localmente. |\n\nEl tamaño del archivo está publicado en el [repositorio del modelo GGUF](https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF/tree/main). El funcionamiento en CPU y la cuantización están documentados en [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp). **Las cifras de RAM y CPU de la tabla son orientaciones de planificación, no requisitos certificados.**\n\nRespecto al **90% de CPU que viste con Ollama**, un modelo pequeño también puede ocupar mucho procesador mientras genera. Podemos limitarlo a dos hilos, a cambio de que tarde más. Además, al terminar podríamos cerrar el proceso y liberar su memoria.\n\nPara nuestro caso probaría **una explicación breve, sin razonamiento extendido y sin ejecutar Demucs simultáneamente**. No te daría todavía una cifra de segundos por respuesta: depende bastante del procesador y debemos medirla. Estos requisitos son para generar texto; la separación de voces sigue teniendo sus propias exigencias.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a17f0e-9475-7ed2-9c32-807f5de4c3a0", "item_id": "01a17f0e-9632-7ed1-979e-565796b9acfb", "rollout_ordinal": 4588, "created_at_ms": 1793133024833, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4588, "started_at_ms": 1793133024833, "completed_at_ms": 1793133024833}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "01a17f0e-9632-7ed1-979e-565796b9acfb", "clientId": "9a05a7a8-2674-4b92-ab05-b541c8ba8823", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Podrías hacer una revisión de \"código residual\", en busca de funciones, ventanas, y demas que estén obsoletas y no se utilicen, la sección de diagnostico no cabe dentro de esa definición\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a17f0e-9475-7ed2-9c32-807f5de4c3a0", "item_id": "msg_02ddfaabedc38a6a016ae109ea4cfc8191a7150f22cdb52e7d", "rollout_ordinal": 4589, "created_at_ms": 1793133031968, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 4589, "started_at_ms": 1793133031968, "completed_at_ms": 1793133034836}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_02ddfaabedc38a6a016ae109ea4cfc8191a7150f22cdb52e7d", "text": "Voy a revisar funciones, ventanas y archivos que hayan quedado sin uso, contrastando sus referencias para distinguir código obsoleto de funciones que siguen disponibles. Mantendré Diagnóstico fuera de los candidatos a retirar y no eliminaré código sin confirmar primero que esté desconectado.\n", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a17f0e-9475-7ed2-9c32-807f5de4c3a0", "item_id": "exec-c68b2c69-c612-4036-b56e-c72d07069d58", "rollout_ordinal": 4593, "created_at_ms": 1793133036241, "item_type": "commandExecution", "updated_at_ordinal": 4593, "started_at_ms": 1793133036241, "completed_at_ms": 1793133036851}, "item": {"type": "commandExecution", "id": "exec-c68b2c69-c612-4036-b56e-c72d07069d58", "pluginId": null, "scriptPath": null, "command": "\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-ChildItem -Name\nrg --files -g AGENTS.md -g '\"'!venv/**'\"'\nrg -n 'function (tuningSummary|marginSummary|trendSummary)|tuningSummary\\\\(|marginSummary\\\\(|trendSummary\\\\(' ui_live/app.js\nGet-Content iniciar_app.bat\nGet-Content iniciar_live.bat\"", "cwd": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke", "processId": "4614", "source": "unifiedExecStartup", "status": "completed", "commandActions": [{"type": "unknown", "command": "Get-ChildItem -Name\nrg --files -g AGENTS.md -g '!venv/**'\nrg -n 'function (tuningSummary|marginSummary|trendSummary)|tuningSummary\\(|marginSummary\\(|trendSummary\\(' ui_live/app.js\nGet-Content iniciar_app.bat\nGet-Content iniciar_live.bat"}], "aggregatedOutput": "__pycache__\r\naudio\r\ncanciones\r\ndata\r\ndocs\r\ngrabaciones\r\nmockups\r\noutput\r\nscripts\r\nseparated\r\ntests\r\nui_live\r\nvenv\r\napp.py\r\nCapitulo_2_Marco_teorico_2.1.docx\r\nCapitulo_2_Marco_teorico_actualizado.docx\r\nCapitulo_3_Metodologia_version_especifica.docx\r\nCapitulo_3_Metodologia.docx\r\nCapitulo_4_Desarrollo_version_especifica.docx\r\nCapitulo_4_Desarrollo.docx\r\nCarta Gantt_actualizada.xlsx\r\nCarta Gantt_entrega.xlsx\r\ncodigo.txt\r\ndesktop_live.py\r\nDestello.wav\r\nEspecificacion_de_Requisitos.docx\r\nHistorias_de_Usuario.docx\r\nIndice_estado_actual_memoria.docx\r\nIndice_tentativo_memoria.docx\r\niniciar_app.bat\r\niniciar_live.bat\r\nmain.py\r\nMorgan Wallen - Chasin' You (Dream Video) - Morgan Wallen (128k).wav\r\nPortada_memoria.docx\r\nPuntos_1.6_y_1.7.docx\r\nQué gano olvidandote.wav\r\nref.csv\r\nReferencias_documento_final.docx\r\nSombra.wav\r\ntest.py\r\nui_feedback.py\r\nusr.csv\r\n2669:function tuningSummary(close, loose) {\r\n2694:function marginSummary(loose) {\r\n2713:function trendSummary(trend, signedCents) {\r\n@echo off\r\nsetlocal\r\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\r\nset \"PYTHONPATH=%CD%\\venv\\Lib\\site-packages\"\r\npy -3.10 app.py\r\n@echo off\r\nsetlocal\r\ncd /d \"%~dp0\"\r\nset \"PYTHONPATH=%CD%\\venv\\Lib\\site-packages\"\r\npy -3.10 desktop_live.py\r\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 610}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a17f0e-9475-7ed2-9c32-807f5de4c3a0", "item_id": "rs_02ddfaabedc38a6a016ae109f273908191b5907b2ebf5471b7", "rollout_ordinal": 4596, "created_at_ms": 1793133040262, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 4596, "started_at_ms": 1793133040262, "completed_at_ms": 1793133041909}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "rs_02ddfaabedc38a6a016ae109f273908191b5907b2ebf5471b7", "summary": [], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a17f0e-9475-7ed2-9c32-807f5de4c3a0", "item_id": "exec-4b0e08fe-8ca8-478f-9369-3a2efe471538", "rollout_ordinal": 4600, "created_at_ms": 1793133046619, "item_type": "commandExecution", "updated_at_ordinal": 4600, "started_at_ms": 1793133046619, "completed_at_ms": 1793133047354}, "item": {"type": "commandExecution", "id": "exec-4b0e08fe-8ca8-478f-9369-3a2efe471538", "pluginId": null, "scriptPath": null, "command": "\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content main.py -TotalCount 65\nGet-Content test.py -TotalCount 65\nGet-ChildItem mockups -Name\nGet-Content ui_live/app.js | Select-Object -Skip 2665 -First 110\nrg -n 'editButton|reprocessButton|deleteButton|library-actions' ui_live/app.js ui_live/index.html ui_live/review.css\"", "cwd": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke", "processId": "92894", "source": "unifiedExecStartup", "status": "completed", "commandActions": [{"type": "unknown", "command": "Get-Content main.py -TotalCount 65\nGet-Content test.py -TotalCount 65\nGet-ChildItem mockups -Name\nGet-Content ui_live/app.js | Select-Object -Skip 2665 -First 110\nrg -n 'editButton|reprocessButton|deleteButton|library-actions' ui_live/app.js ui_live/index.html ui_live/review.css"}], "aggregatedOutput": "from audio.separacion import separar_voz\r\nfrom audio.pitch import extraer_pitch\r\nfrom audio.comparacion import comparar\r\nfrom audio.guardar import guardar_csv\r\nfrom audio.visualizacion import graficar\r\n\r\ndef analizar(ref, usr):\r\n    ref_v = separar_voz(ref)\r\n    usr_v = separar_voz(usr)\r\n\r\n    t_ref, f_ref = extraer_pitch(ref_v)\r\n    t_usr, f_usr = extraer_pitch(usr_v)\r\n\r\n    guardar_csv(\"ref.csv\", t_ref, f_ref)\r\n    guardar_csv(\"usr.csv\", t_usr, f_usr)\r\n    return comparar(f_ref, f_usr)\r\n\r\nres = analizar(\"data/referencia.wav\", \"data/usuario.wav\")\r\nprint(res)\r\nimport librosa\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nimport soundfile as sf\r\nimport pyworld as pw\r\nfrom dtw import dtw\r\n\r\nprint(\"Todo funcionando 🚀\")\r\nindex.html\r\nlab.html\r\nlive.html\r\nmockups.css\r\nstudio.html\r\n  els.averageError.textContent = m?.error_mediano_cents == null ? '--' : Math.abs(m.error_mediano_cents)<=50 ? 'Cerca' : m.error_mediano_cents<0 ? 'Más grave' : 'Más aguda';\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction tuningSummary(close, loose) {\r\n  if (close >= 75) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Muy cerca\",\r\n      note: `${close.toFixed(0)}% quedo practicamente en la nota.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  if (close >= 50) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Buena base\",\r\n      note: `${close.toFixed(0)}% estuvo muy cerca; hay detalles puntuales.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  if (loose >= 65) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Cerca\",\r\n      note: \"La mayoria entro en un margen amplio.\"\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  return {\r\n    title: \"Inestable\",\r\n    note: \"La toma se alejo bastante de la referencia.\"\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction marginSummary(loose) {\r\n  if (loose >= 90) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Comodo\",\r\n      note: `${loose.toFixed(0)}% quedo dentro de un semitono.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  if (loose >= 70) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Aceptable\",\r\n      note: `${loose.toFixed(0)}% quedo cerca de la linea esperada.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  return {\r\n    title: \"Amplio\",\r\n    note: \"Hubo varios desvios grandes entre frases.\"\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction trendSummary(trend, signedCents) {\r\n  const abs = Math.abs(signedCents);\r\n  if (trend === \"agudo\") {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: abs >= 35 ? \"Alta\" : \"Un poco alta\",\r\n      note: `Promedio ${abs.toFixed(0)} cents arriba.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  if (trend === \"grave\") {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: abs >= 35 ? \"Baja\" : \"Un poco baja\",\r\n      note: `Promedio ${abs.toFixed(0)} cents abajo.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  return {\r\n    title: \"Centrada\",\r\n    note: \"No se ve una desviacion sostenida.\"\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction usefulVoiceSummary(points) {\r\n  if (points >= 700) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Toma solida\",\r\n      note: `${points} momentos de voz comparados.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  if (points >= 180) {\r\n    return {\r\n      title: \"Buen tramo\",\r\n      note: `${points} momentos de voz comparados.`\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  return {\r\n    title: \"Toma corta\",\r\n    note: `${points} momentos de voz comparados.`\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showDetail() {\r\n  if (!canUseChartModes()) return;\r\n  state.detail = true;\r\n  state.overview = false;\r\n  els.detailX.max = Math.max(0, currentDuration() - state.viewWindow);\r\n  els.detailX.value = Math.max(0, Math.min(Number(els.detailX.max), state.current - state.viewWindow / 2));\r\n  updateDetailYBounds(Math.round((state.yMin + state.yMax) / 2));\r\n  state.viewStart = Number(els.detailX.value);\r\n  renderChart();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showOverview() {\r\n  if (!canUseChartModes()) return;\r\n  state.detail = false;\r\n  state.overview = true;\r\n  renderChart();\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showFollowView() {\r\n  state.detail = false;\r\n  state.overview = false;\r\n  renderChart();\r\n}\r\n\r\nui_live/index.html:59:          <div class=\"library-actions\">\r\nui_live/index.html:60:            <button class=\"button\" id=\"editButton\" type=\"button\" disabled>Editar</button>\r\nui_live/index.html:61:            <button class=\"button\" id=\"reprocessButton\" type=\"button\" disabled>Reprocesar</button>\r\nui_live/index.html:62:            <button class=\"button button-danger\" id=\"deleteButton\" type=\"button\" disabled>Eliminar</button>\r\nui_live/app.js:120:  editButton: document.getElementById(\"editButton\"),\r\nui_live/app.js:123:  reprocessButton: document.getElementById(\"reprocessButton\"),\r\nui_live/app.js:124:  deleteButton: document.getElementById(\"deleteButton\"),\r\nui_live/app.js:928:  els.editButton.disabled = !backendReady || busy || !song?.id;\r\nui_live/app.js:929:  els.reprocessButton.disabled = !backendReady || busy || !song?.id;\r\nui_live/app.js:930:  els.deleteButton.disabled = !backendReady || busy || !song?.id;\r\nui_live/app.js:2787:els.editButton.addEventListener(\"click\", editSelectedSong);\r\nui_live/app.js:2788:els.reprocessButton.addEventListener(\"click\", reprocessSelectedSong);\r\nui_live/app.js:2789:els.deleteButton.addEventListener(\"click\", deleteSelectedSong);\r\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 734}}
